gametitle=Madden NFL 2004 (SLUS-20752) [14F8B841]
comment=DT-HOLD-90 v2 -- BOTH halves of the double-team hold extended to ~90 ticks.

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// R6a. TWO words, one per timer initialiser, because the pairing dies when
// EITHER side's timer expires and v1 of this patch extended only one of them.
//
// The aggressive re-review of v1 (double-team-mechanism.md, Site B section)
// found the deployed single word did NOT extend the pairing: Site B stamps
// p3 -- the PRIMARY blocker, gated `bne v1, 4` on HIS kind -- while the
// HELPER's own kind-8 timer comes from Site A's kind-7/8 band copy. With only
// Site B patched, the helper still detached at 15-30 ticks and the double
// team still died by ~frame 43. The binding constraint was the unpatched word.
//
//   Site A  0x001ef918  2403001e -> 2403005a   addiu v1, zero, 30 -> 90
//           the re-decision's kind-7/8 band copy: initialises the timer when
//           a player LOCKS IN to kind 8 (the helper's attachment). The 2-4
//           band copy at 0x001ef8e8 is NOT touched: ordinary single blocks
//           (kinds 3/4) keep 30 - rating/16. Kind 7's up-counter (limit 61)
//           is initialised elsewhere and is not touched either -- review D5's
//           self-defeat hazard checked on both words.
//   Site B  0x001f2108  2414001e -> 2414005a   addiu s4, zero, 30 -> 90
//           the double-team stamp: the PRIMARY's kind-4 contact timer while
//           doubled. Register audit: s4 set once, consumed once (subu at
//           0x001f222c), restored. Sole caller 0x001f733c.
//
// Both stamped kinds (8 and 4) are DOWN-counters with underflow exits
// (0x001f5c4c-6c and 0x001f5c84-b4). Effect: both halves hold 90 - rating/16
// = 75..90 ticks (~1.25-1.5 s) against the baseline 15..30.
//
// CORRECTED CLAIM from v1: "pass plays structurally unaffected" was FALSE.
// DT-1 gates the dt REGISTRY, but engagement kind 8 occurs on pass plays --
// measured on slot 7 (RG oscillating kinds 7<->8 for 130+ frames). Site A
// fires there, so pass protection CAN move. Slot 7's pass_protection.py run
// is a REQUIRED regression arm for this patch, not a freebie. Watch the
// +0x432 reader at 0x001ca0e8 (`slti v0, v0, 61`): a 75-90 timer flips that
// gate for its first ~29 ticks, a path baseline timers never took.
//
// Bisect path if acceptance fails: comment out one line and rerun -- the two
// sites are independently patchable by design.
//
// pnach `extended` width lives in the address's leading digit; 2 = 32-bit.
//
// Acceptance vs slot 9 frozen-seed baseline:
//   dt_last_hold_frame  43    -> materially later (target: past ~100)
//   carrier_yards      -0.70  -> anything else
//   operator: linemen STAYING on the double, a visible sustained drive
// Regression: slot 7 pass_protection.py (required, see above); a single-block
// run savestate when one exists.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

patch=1,EE,201ef918,extended,2403005a
patch=1,EE,201f2108,extended,2414005a
